'''Forbidden Magic''' is a type of [[magic]] that, as the name implies, has been banned from use since the declarations of the [[Day of the Pact]].

==History==
On the [[Day of the Pact]], it was decided that all magic that is drawn on the human body or affects the human body, with the exception of the Memory-wiping spell, would be outlawed. Spells that greatly affects the environment are also considered to be forbidden. [[Knights Moralis|The Knights Moralis]] were formed shortly after as the ones to uphold this law, and wipe the minds of those who broke it. However, some [[Witches|witches]] still practiced forbidden magic in secret, eventually forming the [[Brimmed Hat Group|Brimmed Hats]]. 

